  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\log _{10}\\left(\\frac{3 x-x^2}{2}\\right) \\geq 0\n$$\nor $\\log _{10}\\left(\\frac{3 x-x^2}{2}\\right) \\geq \\log _{10} 1$\nor $x^2-3 x+2 \\leq 0$\nor $x \\in[1,2]$ and $\\frac{3 x-x^2}{2}>0$\n$$\n\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{X} \\in[1,2]\n$$"
